        "policy_item_FWnx4A": {
          "type": "policy_item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "",
            "content": "<p>Stretchable Covers will always do everything possible to keep shipping costs to a minimum.</p><ul><li>Domestic orders (within the USA) will allow for a choice between USPS, FedEx or UPS. If a service chosen is not readily available, we will choose the best possible way to ship. Note: UPS and FedEx will not deliver to P.O. boxes so please supply your full street address for your order.</li><li>If expedited shipping service is requested, USPS, FedEx and UPS offer one-day, two-day or three-day services.</li><li>Costs are calculated via our Corporate Accounts and are automatically discounted for each order accordingly.</li><li>Freight costs for international orders will be based on the best real-time rates from USPS, FedEx or UPS Worldwide Services.</li></ul>"
          }
        },
        "policy_item_JEwKJF": {
          "type": "policy_item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "SHIPPING METHOD DISCLAIMER",
            "content": "<p>We will abide my preferred shipping methods as instructed on customer orders, but will not be held liable for delayed deliveries on the part of the shipping companies.</p>"
          }
        },
        "policy_item_fAXAfm": {
          "type": "policy_item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "PLEASE KEEP IN MIND",
            "content": "<p><strong>SHIPPING TIME</strong> and<strong> PRODUCTION TIME </strong>are two very different things. For example: If you request 2-day shipping, that does not mean you will receive your order in two days from the time you placed it online. It must first be processed and produced. Then in will be shipped by your preferred method. Each order is produced as it is received. Other than blank items, we do not keep any pre-printed items in stock.</p>"
          }
